      <div class="view-head"><h2>家宽模式</h2><p>VPN Gate OpenVPN 家宽出口，经隧道前置拨号（仅 ${_d(_0x28a82d(0x19a1,'\x46\x52\x66\x52')+'\x32\x31\x76')} 内核）</p></div>
